  "detailed_description": "<h1>加入官方社群</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/f08d1ce12afb579e39c37b82ad888221.avif?t=1792462945\" width=1500 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >联机开黑 · 反馈BUG · 交流游戏 请加入《风暴怕死队》官方QQ群</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群4：1054798871</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群5：1076449457</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群6：1076458451</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群1：857014579(满)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群2：1058491912(满)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群3：1081231950(满)</p></p><br><h1>功能站</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入官方功能站小程序，随时随地获取游戏最新资讯、查看道具图鉴、自由模拟BD搭配、分享构筑！<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/251c1e30abf2590ccad7c843e5b3e7fe.avif?t=1792462945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras_big/251c1e30abf2590ccad7c843e5b3e7fe.avif?t=1792462945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/587b8b46257a8065ee1d01999793a329.poster.avif?t=1792462945\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/587b8b46257a8065ee1d01999793a329.webm?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/587b8b46257a8065ee1d01999793a329.mp4?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一支在逃亡路上东拼西凑出来的队伍，铁桶骑士，炸弹萌妹，独眼老登，理财达人，还有路边捡来的神秘修女......明明个个都“怕死”，却不得不拿起枪，硬着头皮上了战场！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你们的目标是在12小时内逃离这座岛，却在海岸线遭遇了令人绝望的风暴之墙，随着怪物越来越多，一个黑暗的阴谋正在揭开......</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/ae48c787342c3d53d4f37c7a5e1e3973.avif?t=1792462945\" width=960 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >花式枪械、特效枪头、秘宝合成、塔罗占卜、元素效果、随机事件......每一次拾取都是你的枪械改造实验。是堆满弹道，化身“烟花大师”，还是一发入魂，蒸发血条，你的枪由你定义。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/11dc600badbeffa10b40417e9553fa6d.poster.avif?t=1792462945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/11dc600badbeffa10b40417e9553fa6d.webm?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/11dc600badbeffa10b40417e9553fa6d.mp4?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/f0736eb4a2011705c106f9265f6685f1.avif?t=1792462945\" width=960 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >［碎裂］、［启程］、［生长］、［末弹］、［紊乱］...... 没有标准答案，只有更离谱的组合。合理搭配他们！即可享受异常连锁、无限大招、循环触发、指数级伤害膨胀等等，每一次“胡牌”，都是一局爽到停不下来的疯狂体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/ce9dff2c8ea83006ef4225d9eb95b8bf.poster.avif?t=1792462945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/ce9dff2c8ea83006ef4225d9eb95b8bf.webm?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/ce9dff2c8ea83006ef4225d9eb95b8bf.mp4?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/bb38b72d7c3925a333606d6e4720a5ce.avif?t=1792462945\" width=960 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >随着冒险不断深入，［角色天赋］与［小队天赋］会帮助你不断成长变得更强！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更高的难度和更强的敌人，同时也能享受更高的爆率，也将解锁独特的［混沌战痕］模式—— 每条战痕都兼具强化与诅咒，高风险与高收益并存。善用强化、驾驭诅咒，打造独一无二、突破极限的终极流派！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/616f4fb5e6f52223cbbb23ee013c6545.poster.avif?t=1792462945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/616f4fb5e6f52223cbbb23ee013c6545.webm?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/616f4fb5e6f52223cbbb23ee013c6545.mp4?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/7b8b88eb1457b7b61f865a8767e3d2eb.avif?t=1792462945\" width=960 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >关于联机，互相救场、道具交换，一起突破难关......这些当然都有！但更有趣的是，前期摸鱼发育，后期伤害反超！快看看DPS榜单，你们队伍里谁是真正的输出王，谁又是那个被迫默默奉献的&quot;工具人&quot;呢？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/54c2dcd1eb98a097715aaa0aaae87808.poster.avif?t=1792462945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/54c2dcd1eb98a097715aaa0aaae87808.webm?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561220/extras/54c2dcd1eb98a097715aaa0aaae87808.mp4?t=1792462945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>加入社群/DISCORD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果你有bug和建议想要反馈，或者只是想聊聊你超帅的BD，你可以在我们的社群/QQ群/Discord上做这些事情！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群1：857014579</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群2：1058491912</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群3：1081231950</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群4：1054798871</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群5：1076449457</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群6：1076458451</p>",
